# Recorded input for the toggle button page (widgets/toggle.zig, `Page`), at 320 x 80 in the
# default theme: B, I and U (pressed) on a toolbar, faces at x 12..36, 44..69 and 77..101, on
# y 12..46. One line per frame below (format: input.Replay). Scancodes: Enter 40, Space 44.
# 0: rest: U pressed
frame
viewport 320 80
dt 0.016
pointer 300 70
# 1: press B
frame
pointer 24 29
buttons left
# 2: release: B pressed, under the pointer
frame
buttons
# 3: Enter on the focused B: released
frame
pointer 300 70
press 40
# 4: Space up: pressed again
frame
release 44
# 5: press I
frame
pointer 56 29
buttons left
# 6: release: I pressed
frame
buttons
# 7: press U, drag off, release: no flip
frame
pointer 89 29
buttons left
# 8: dragged off
frame
pointer 300 70
# 9: released off it
frame
buttons
